# aarch64 baseline of the final hardening code. Not measured on this
# machine but on the native GitHub arm64 runner (ubuntu-26.04-arm), CI
# run 40895881758, job "Native (ubuntu-26.04-arm)", step "Binary sizes",
# commit 431d8df (plan-hardening), rustc 1.98.1 from rust-toolchain.toml,
# release profile of Cargo.toml. The run of the final code commit
# 420a714 itself (run 40892284640) stopped at the script tests before
# its native job, because of a test-only bug; 431d8df differs from 420a714
# only in scripts and tests, no shipped source, so the sizes are those of
# the final code. The x86_64 account is in docs/benchmarks/binary-size.md;
# no per-area aarch64 account exists.
inacircle 987912 702692
